    LLM: "Bid only if you have a strong hand or can use the stock. The stock is 4 cards (12.5% of deck). It can make or break you. Count trumps carefully. The Jack (Jass) and Nine (Ninel) are critical.\n\nThe 'Blind 2' Bid: A risky bid made without looking. Can pay off big if you hit.\n\nSignaling: Discards can signal suit preference. Watch for partner's signals.",
